  "description": "High-performance io_uring transport for ASP.NET Core Kestrel. Drop-in replacement for the default socket transport with multishot recv, buffer rings, zero-copy send, and registered files. Up to 30% faster at 128+ concurrent connections on Linux.",
  "id": "Kestrel.Transport.IoUring",
